			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Reformat build configuration and regenerate build artifacts\n\nStandardize ESBuild configuration files and source entry points to use tab-based indentation and trailing commas, aligning with the project's strict code style. Reorder imports in `Configuration/ESBuild` files to separate path utilities from internal configurations and group environment constants at the module scope.\n\nTrigger a full rebuild of the Cocoon extension host sidecar, updating the `RouteManifest` timestamp to reflect the current repository state. Regenerate all TypeScript build artifacts, source maps, and the `tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` cache to ensure the 118 known Mountain RPC methods are correctly registered for the gRPC server.",
			"SHA": "44c4e97097d022746510459bf431c0ff0e457609"
